Package: MixedDiversityAnalysis
Title: Analysis and Visualization of Mixed-Trait Dissimilarity
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Santosha", "Rathod", role = "aut"), person("Prabhat", "Kumar", email = "prabhatkkv@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")), person("A. K.", "Jukanti", role = "aut"), person("Radha", "Upadhyay", role = "aut"), person("Prashantkumar S", "Hanjagi", role = "aut"), person("Basavaraj", "PS", role = "aut"), person("R. N.", "Singh", role = "aut"), person("Anil", "Kumar", role = "aut"))
Description: Provides methods for analysing datasets containing quantitative, qualitative, binary, and ordinal traits. Computes mixed-trait dissimilarities and performs hierarchical clustering using multiple linkage methods. Supports principal coordinates analysis (PCoA), cluster evaluation, trait contribution analysis, and graphical visualization. The package facilitates mixed-trait diversity assessment and characterization of crop germplasm. For more detail see Gower (1971) <doi:10.2307/2528823> and Jukanti et al. (2026) <doi:10.1007/s44187-025-00715-w>.
